      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey! so i've been really focusing on optimizing my health routine lately, and i just added a high-potency vitamin k supplement to my daily stack to really boost my bone density. i'm still on my regular warfarin for my heart rhythm, but i'm trying to be super proactive about my long-term wellness lol. \n\nsince i'm basically stacking these two now, i wanted to ask if there's a specific protocol or timing i should follow to get the best synergy between them? like, is there a certain way to take them together so they work most effectively for my overall health?",
